.DS_Store
# Audition candidate dumps. The CURATED state of each dir is committed
# deliberately (force-added) so the audition galleries work from any checkout;
# the ignore keeps future bulk pulls from sneaking in without an explicit
# `git add -f`. Per-dir licences live next to the files.
#   _stk-audition/    STK SFX (mixed CC-BY-SA/GPL/CC0)   → /sfx-audition.html
#   _engine-audition/ OpenGameArt engine clips (mostly CC0) → /engine-audition.html
#   _music-pool/      race-music candidates (all CC-BY 4.0) → /music-pool-audition.html
public/assets/audio/_stk-audition/
public/assets/audio/_engine-audition/
public/assets/audio/_music-pool/
# Local-only Claude Code state — keeps the .claude/ root committable for shared
# project settings/hooks while excluding per-user runtime files (worktrees,
# local settings, scheduler lock).
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
native/build/
